TOP 10 HOTELS IN BAGUIO (BASED ON REAL GUEST RATINGS). 
Planning a Baguio trip soon? Perfect timing!  Panagbenga Festival is happening next month, and hotels are already filling up fast! If you’re still deciding where to stay, here are my Top 10 Baguio Hotels, ranked using actual guest reviews from major booking platforms. These aren’t random picks. I consolidated ratings from Klook, TripAdvisor, Agoda (converted to 5⭐ scale), and Google, then averaged them to get each hotel’s overall score.￼ 📌 You can book these hotels using the Agoda and Klook links listed below, and don’t forget to use my discount codes to save:
🎟️ Klook: XPLOREDDKLOOK
🏨 Agoda: XPLOREAGODA￼

⚠️ Disclaimer:
Ratings are a blended average from Klook, TripAdvisor, Agoda (10-point scores converted to 5⭐), and Google. Not all hotels appear on every platform, so each hotel’s overall rating is computed using available sources only. Rankings may change over time as reviews update.

🔥 Tip: If you’re traveling for Panagbenga, book early — prices go up and good rooms sell out fast.
Save this post for later and tell me which hotel you’re eyeing! 👀🏨
